    "title": "LSU Women's Basketball Ranks No. 6 in Latest AP Poll",
    "text": "• LSU women's basketball is ranked No. 6 in the latest AP poll.\n• LSU moved up one spot from the previous poll.\n• LSU defeated Ole Miss, which fell to No. 19, and Missouri.\n• UConn, UCLA, South Carolina, and Texas hold the top four spots, respectively.\n• Michigan is ranked No. 5.\n• Vanderbilt is ranked No. 6.\n• Louisville, Oklahoma, and Ohio State round out the top 10.\n• LSU will host No. 21 Tennessee on Thursday and travel to Mississippi State on Sunday.\n• Winning both games would likely secure LSU the No. 4 spot in the conference standings and a double bye for the SEC Tournament.",
